Modifications by this 8K overlay fork
-------------------------------------

This repository is a fork of armel/uv-k1-k5v3-firmware-custom at upstream
tag v6.1.0 (commit f556a96), distributed under the Apache License 2.0.
As required by Apache-2.0 section 4, the modifications made by this fork
are:

  1. The overlay App execution window was enlarged from 4 KiB to 8 KiB
     (0x1000 -> 0x2000) and the App slot stride from 0x2000 to 0x3000,
     with the minimum stack reserve reduced to 704 B so the firmware
     still fits the 16 KiB of RAM;
  2. API level 2 uid_get() was added ahead of the Labs-only system
     information block so that its struct offset (276) is preset
     independent, and the per-slot configuration buffer was enlarged
     from 16 to 64 bytes;
  3. The displayed version string defaults to "v6.1.0+8K".

All other content is unmodified from the upstream release stated above.

This fork is published in the spirit of the upstream authors' request to
forking developers: keep forks open source.
